WEBVTT

00:00:00.780 --> 00:00:03.200
Wait, what is this strange wind doing?

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:05.750
Hold on! We can still make it!

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:11.750
I am the Origami Warden.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.850
I protect the artist's first flame.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.950
Who dares disturb this sanctuary?

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:21.850
State your purpose, traveler.
